# ENV_VAR=<bitwarden-secrets-manager-secret-uuid>
# Resolved by bin/apply -> /etc/homelab-pi/zigbee2mqtt.env.
#
# zigbee2mqtt has no required secret today. This file exists so the applier can
# treat every app uniformly and so future secrets (e.g. MQTT credentials moved
# out of configuration.yaml) are a one-line addition. An empty map produces an
# empty env file, which is valid.
